stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "active? (derived)" as active
    state "revoked_at present (retirement may be pending)" as revoked
    state "revoked and retirement_pending? false (derived)" as retired
    [*] --> active
    active --> active: issue_refresh_token! / rotate_refresh_token!
    active --> revoked: revoke!
    revoked --> revoked: revoke! repeat
    revoked --> retired: retirement_pending? clock predicate
    retired --> [*]
    note right of active
        Labels are predicates; root/refresh expiry can also deactivate.
        Unknown max JWT expiry prevents proven retirement.
        last_logout_status is an outcome, not lifecycle.
    end note
